      "id": "compiler-profile-is-unit-level",
      "rule": "The compiler profile belongs to the unit context (layout/compiler-profiles.json): use the packet profile as given; a code-shape mismatch that only /Og explains is profile evidence for the unit (report it), not a per-function flag to try.",
